FROM mambaorg/micromamba:1.5.8
USER root
WORKDIR /app
# Create env with bio tools + python deps
COPY conda/env.yaml /tmp/env.yaml
RUN micromamba create -y -n epimod -f /tmp/env.yaml && \
    micromamba clean --all --yes
SHELL ["/bin/bash", "-lc"]
ENV MAMBA_DEFAULT_ENV=epimod
ENV PATH=/opt/conda/envs/epimod/bin:$PATH

# Python deps
COPY services/worker/requirements.txt /app/requirements.txt
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r /app/requirements.txt

# Code
COPY services/worker /app
COPY models /models

ENTRYPOINT ["bash", "-lc"]
CMD ["celery", "-A", "tasks.celery_app", "worker", "--loglevel=INFO", "-Q", "default"]